{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NAD</strong> is a 2D pixel art game that combines tower defense and roguelike elements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[ Background ]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, an ordinary college student, suddenly finds themselves transported to another world after being hit by a truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There, they learn that the residents of this world have been suffering for years due to mysterious underground tremors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure into the underground world to rescue the inhabitants of this new realm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[ Game Overview ]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NAD</strong> blends tower defense with roguelike, crafting, and sandbox elements, offering a rich gameplay experience with a main story, unlockable content, multiple endings, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>NAD</strong>, players can dig through underground caves, freely shaping enemy paths for strategic gameplay. During the day, explore the map, mine resources, and build various towers. When night falls, monsters emerge and follow the paths you\u2019ve set\u2014so prepare your defenses and stop the invasion!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518990?t=1741677560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518990?t=1741677560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518990/986be9c8e361e0b45204463c008ba15a1b2c0ba9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741677560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518990/986be9c8e361e0b45204463c008ba15a1b2c0ba9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741677560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NAD</strong> is a 2D pixel art game that combines tower defense and roguelike elements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[ Background ]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, an ordinary college student, suddenly finds themselves transported to another world after being hit by a truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There, they learn that the residents of this world have been suffering for years due to mysterious underground tremors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure into the underground world to rescue the inhabitants of this new realm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[ Game Overview ]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NAD</strong> blends tower defense with roguelike, crafting, and sandbox elements, offering a rich gameplay experience with a main story, unlockable content, multiple endings, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>NAD</strong>, players can dig through underground caves, freely shaping enemy paths for strategic gameplay. During the day, explore the map, mine resources, and build various towers. When night falls, monsters emerge and follow the paths you\u2019ve set\u2014so prepare your defenses and stop the invasion!</p>","developers":["DevNeo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518990/23b58317418166f8fdf80938d6dee903fee5f38a/header.jpg?t=1741677560","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112783,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112783/movie480.mp4?t=1741677556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112783/movie_max.mp4?t=1741677556"},"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112783/56fd55cc10ff3993fa9294c4f3153865b2be2639/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741677556","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112783/